GSE240114 (human, 4 cell lines)
================================

SOURCE
------
GSE240114 (NCBI GEO), from the LiMCA paper (Wu et al. 2024, Nat Methods,
DOI: 10.1038/s41592-024-02239-0). Downloaded 2026-06-29. 23.5 GB raw,
not tracked in Git (see below).

DIRECTORY STRUCTURE
--------------------
data/2026-06-29/{BJ, K562, GM12878}/           *.allValidPairs.txt
data/2026-06-29/eHAP/standard/                 *.allValidPairs.txt  <- used these
data/2026-06-29/eHAP/e_variant/                *.e.allValidPairs.txt

Cell counts: BJ 63, K562 63, eHAP 42, GM12878 220 (cell_032 missing).

NOT TRACKED IN GIT
--------------------
Raw .allValidPairs.txt files excluded using .gitignore (data/**/*.txt, *.gz,
*.tar, *.hic) -- 23.5 GB is beyond what Git handles well. To recreate:
Download GSE240114 from GEO, extract .allValidPairs.txt.gz per structure
above. Also excluded from the working set: .hic, .impute.pairs.gz,
*.3dg.txt.gz, GSE240114_RAW.tar.


GSE303006 (mouse, CHARM, brain cortex)
========================================

SOURCE
------
GSE303006 (NCBI GEO), CHARM dataset, mouse brain cortex only (mESC portion
of the series not downloaded/used). GRCm38/mm10, confirmed from .pairs file
headers (chr1 = 195,471,971). Downloaded 2026-07-15.

DIRECTORY STRUCTURE
--------------------
data/2026-07-15/GSE303006_charm_metadata_qcpass.tsv    cellname -> celltype
data/2026-07-15/geo_submit/brain_pairs/pairs/          *.pairs (raw, flat)
data/2026-07-15/<celltype>/                            *.pairs (sorted, via
                                                         scripts/sort_cells_by_celltype.py)

Cell counts (brain cortex, 19 celltypes, 4265 total): Ex_L3/4_IT 538,
Ex_L2/3_IT 528, Inh_MSN 413, Ex_OB 333, Ex_Unknown1 307, Ex_L6_CT 288,
Ast 276, Ex_L5/6_IT 238, Inh_Unknown1 237, Inh_Pvalb 159, Inh_Sst 152,
Inh_Vip 141, OPC 136, ODC 116, Inh_Ndnf/Lamp5 88, Ex_CL 80, Inh_Unknown2 74,
Microglia 70, Ex_L5/6_NP 64, Ex_Unknown2 27.
805 mESC cells listed in metadata, not downloaded, not used.

NOT TRACKED IN GIT
--------------------
Raw .pairs and .tsv files excluded via .gitignore (data/**/*.pairs,
data/**/*.tsv). To recreate: download GSE303006 from GEO
(brain_pairs supplementary files + charm_metadata_qcpass.tsv), then run
scripts/sort_cells_by_celltype.py to rebuild the per-celltype structure.